            <div class="col-lg-6 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <div class="about-content ps-0 ps-lg-3">
                    <h3>Our Vision & Mission</h3>
                    <p class="fst-italic">
                        <strong>Vision:</strong> To be the leading and most trusted diversified business enterprise in Uganda, delivering quality services and sustainable solutions that improve communities and transform lives.
                    </p>
                    <p class="fst-italic" style="margin-top: 15px;">
                        <strong>Mission:</strong> To provide exceptional event management, catering, agricultural, financial agency, and supply services through professionalism, innovation, integrity, and customer satisfaction while creating sustainable value for our clients and communities.
